sequenceDiagram
  participant E as Edge/Admission
  participant R as ReleaseController
  participant Q as WorkQueue
  participant W as Worker/Harness
  participant S as Transcript/Effect Store
  participant O as Telemetry/Cost/Eval
  E->>R: stable bucket + release selection
  E->>Q: work(run, release, policy, schema)
  Q->>W: lease to compatible ready worker
  W->>S: append intent / state transition
  W->>W: model + Tool Loop + H7-1 checks
  W->>S: commit result or indeterminate marker
  W->>O: metadata attempt/usage/evaluation
  O-->>R: candidate SLI window
  R-->>E: hold / advance / rollback route
  R-->>W: continue / drain
